、“Gelato”。2020年加入台灣索尼音樂。\n2023年，炎亞綸被指控多項性犯罪，耀樂表示炎亞綸在2018年時偷拍並外流其性行為影片，當時炎亞綸約32歲，耀樂16歲。2024年士林地方法院判決炎犯拍攝少年為性交行為之電子訊號罪、無故持有少年性影像罪、非公務機關非法利用個人資料罪合併執行有期徒刑7個月，緩刑3年，2024年5月未上訴全案定讞。","transform":"Face cropped, eye line aligned, resized; revealed progressively during play","processorVersion":2},"replacement":{"photo":"photos/s017_r2.jpg","reveal":{"eyes":[0.08,0.2771830273281996,0.92,0.4336633257045867],"nose":[0.08,0.2771830273281996,0.92,0.5779220921218775],"mouth":[0.08,0.2771830273281996,0.92,0.7042288616204718],"chin":[0.08,0.2771830273281996,0.92,0.831584432808457],"full":[0,0,1,1]},"attribution":{"source":"https://www.mirrormedia.mg/story/20260120ent035","article":"https://www.mirrormedia.mg/story/20260120ent035","artist":"","credit":"重新回到舞台　炎亞綸宣告3月登高流舉辦《Ikigai》演唱會 - 鏡週刊 Mirror Media","license":"Copyright retained by original source; no open licence asserted","licenseUrl":""},"photoStatus":"reviewed","humanReviewed":true,"photoRevision":{"date":"2026-10-22","reason":"Complete portrait quality audit: clearer unobstructed source","imageUrl":"https://v3-statics.mirrormedia.mg/images/ea652db9-0c23-4023-8310-5c01e5d9e559.jpg"}}},{"id":"s018","name":"汪東城","previous":{"id":"s018","name":"汪東城","aliases":["汪東城","Jiro Wang","汪东城"],"photo":"photos/s018.jpg","reveal":{"eyes":[0.08,0.2822593474656008,0.92,0.4126294596811359],"nose":[0.08,0.2822593474656008,0.92,0.5478607777799114],"mouth":[0.08,0.2822593474656008,0.92,0.713606450798806],"chin":[0.08,0.2822593474656008,0.92,0.8785550338230778],"full":[0,0,1,1]},"photoStatus":"automatic_landmark_checks_passed","processorVersion":2,"humanReviewed":false,"eligibility":"pending_source_check","attribution":{"article":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%AA%E6%9D%B1%E5%9F%8E","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:JIROWANG.jpg","artist":"Terrilam","credit":"自己的作品","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","attribution":""},"bioExcerpt":"汪東城（1981年8月24日—)，台灣男歌手、演員。2000年代時以模特兒踏入演藝圈，曾